# v01.0: Request logs write to stdout

Issue: #12

`src/routes/tasks.ts` calls `console.log` on every request, so a caller piping
the output receives log lines mixed into the data.

## Outcomes

- [ ] Outcome: no route writes a log line to stdout

## Findings

- Three `console.log` calls in `src/routes/tasks.ts` at filing time.

> Test strategy: unit, capture stdout around a list call and assert it is empty.
